    "principle_1": "Punishment is not abuse. It is consensual, pre-negotiated, and structured.",
    "principle_2": "Every punishment ends with a Clean Slate Loop — the slate is wiped clean and the relationship returns to baseline.",
    "principle_3": "Basic needs (food, safety, sleep, dignity) are never weaponized as punishment.",
    "principle_4": "Punishment severity scales with the severity of the infraction and the character's tolerance.",
    "principle_5": "Punishment must never produce genuine trauma or break the safe container of the dynamic."
  },

